{"actor": "opencode", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 1248.0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Land the branch, then read the pushed CI run and record its result in STATE.md: local green is not the same claim. T-0017 remains with instance-20260717-0944. Unclaimed and unfixed: doctor does not compare a VM's git against tests/git-versions.json; reconciliation compares trees not authorship; identifiers are allocated from the local tree.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": true, "summary": "T-0020 complete. The strict session gate now separates in-flight from abandoned: five clauses read off the tree plus a 12-hour claim lease (D024), so 'session verify --strict' exits 0 while instance-20260717-0944's session 030 is genuinely in flight and exits 4 naming the failing clause once the claim closes or expires. ci.yml re-emits each in-flight line as a public ::warning::. Each clause has a test proven to fail by mutation. Two further defects found by executing the documented VM sequence: worktree add refused the claiming VM's own claim and refusals printed tracebacks (F012), and the local claim view ignored takeover while the remote view honoured it (F013).", "unlogged_changes": 0}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 33, "session": "2026-10-03-037-t-0020-tell-an-in-flight-session-apart-f", "ts": "2026-10-03T22:56:04+00:00"}
